{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you master time itself?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/0c01c10d1bd135c5d77c386d5f1f2036.poster.avif?t=1764870604\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/0c01c10d1bd135c5d77c386d5f1f2036.webm?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/0c01c10d1bd135c5d77c386d5f1f2036.mp4?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo Weaver is a time loop metroidbrainia where time is your best resource and secrets are your only upgrades. You're the last of the Weavers, a remnant of a ruined society trapped in a glitching time loop. The Congregation set out to explore the stars and find paradise. What they found instead has led their utopian project to ash and cinders. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you master time itself to unravel the conspiracy at the heart of Provenance?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/ea92059013817bf900eacafab3b1e829.poster.avif?t=1764870604\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/ea92059013817bf900eacafab3b1e829.webm?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/ea92059013817bf900eacafab3b1e829.mp4?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To track down leads in your quest, you'll need the help of crafty characters stuck just as deep in the time loop as you are. A sentient advertisement AI in the form of a cute cat. A rebellious leader trying to protect survivors of Provenance's Collapse. A wicked cleric evangelizing the doom of Provenance to any who might listen. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you master time itself to free all those trapped in the confines of eternal repetition?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/b6f0750fec577eccc2929cd5d2b3268b.poster.avif?t=1764870604\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/b6f0750fec577eccc2929cd5d2b3268b.webm?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/b6f0750fec577eccc2929cd5d2b3268b.mp4?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine tune your skills to blaze through new routes, harvest potent echoes, and exploit time as your most precious resource. Unearth powerful secrets to reshape the timeline and master the loop, turning your prison into your salvation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you master time itself to chart the perfect path through a world determined to end you?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/c2b69e2acc6e8e4b7db947ef99d9b237.poster.avif?t=1764870604\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/c2b69e2acc6e8e4b7db947ef99d9b237.webm?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/c2b69e2acc6e8e4b7db947ef99d9b237.mp4?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you master time itself...</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2184080?t=1764870604","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764870604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/f14a491f26328b22210fefb36481fb9f3fc67dcf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764870604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/f14a491f26328b22210fefb36481fb9f3fc67dcf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764870604","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3062420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/d3028e9d734078fa4ef805e6b2b34a41.avif?t=1764870604\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras_big/d3028e9d734078fa4ef805e6b2b34a41.avif?t=1764870604 width=800 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TIME IS CURRENCY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The loop itself is a consumable resource: grab pickups to extend it, then draw from it to unlock gates, heal, trade, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SECRETS ARE GEAR\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No upgrades, no unlocks, just secrets. In the &quot;metroidbrainia&quot;, you can already do everything, you just don't know how yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRECISION = PERFECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The loop can only be cracked and broken by an expert. Luckily, you have all the time in the world to hone your platforming prowess.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UTOPIA COLLAPSED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The congregation explored the stars looking for paradise. They found something else. </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you master time itself?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/0c01c10d1bd135c5d77c386d5f1f2036.poster.avif?t=1764870604\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/0c01c10d1bd135c5d77c386d5f1f2036.webm?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/0c01c10d1bd135c5d77c386d5f1f2036.mp4?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echo Weaver is a time loop metroidbrainia where time is your best resource and secrets are your only upgrades. You're the last of the Weavers, a remnant of a ruined society trapped in a glitching time loop. The Congregation set out to explore the stars and find paradise. What they found instead has led their utopian project to ash and cinders. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you master time itself to unravel the conspiracy at the heart of Provenance?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/ea92059013817bf900eacafab3b1e829.poster.avif?t=1764870604\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/ea92059013817bf900eacafab3b1e829.webm?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/ea92059013817bf900eacafab3b1e829.mp4?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To track down leads in your quest, you'll need the help of crafty characters stuck just as deep in the time loop as you are. A sentient advertisement AI in the form of a cute cat. A rebellious leader trying to protect survivors of Provenance's Collapse. A wicked cleric evangelizing the doom of Provenance to any who might listen. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you master time itself to free all those trapped in the confines of eternal repetition?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/b6f0750fec577eccc2929cd5d2b3268b.poster.avif?t=1764870604\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/b6f0750fec577eccc2929cd5d2b3268b.webm?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/b6f0750fec577eccc2929cd5d2b3268b.mp4?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine tune your skills to blaze through new routes, harvest potent echoes, and exploit time as your most precious resource. Unearth powerful secrets to reshape the timeline and master the loop, turning your prison into your salvation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you master time itself to chart the perfect path through a world determined to end you?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/c2b69e2acc6e8e4b7db947ef99d9b237.poster.avif?t=1764870604\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/c2b69e2acc6e8e4b7db947ef99d9b237.webm?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/extras/c2b69e2acc6e8e4b7db947ef99d9b237.mp4?t=1764870604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you master time itself...</strong></h2>","developers":["Moonlight Kids"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184080/3faccd633536efa4653e67629a5b7dd0abb94814/header.jpg?t=1764870604","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Big Sur+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 630<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2184080/846542/7bd7090c7f210c615c08b6dcb28d29f85126dfa7/1751086879/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741710303","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2184080/846542/7bd7090c7f210c615c08b6dcb28d29f85126dfa7/1751086879/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741710303","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.stea